{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p11514","chapterId":"s53d00cb6fdc8da4c","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p11514-fa54d407945319f31052","entryId":"other-interaction-p11514","chapterId":"s53d00cb6fdc8da4c","text":"헤이, 친구, 이번 앰버기원의 가장 화려한 마술쇼가 곧 시작되니 가지 마","speaker":"미스터 퍼즐","mission":"≪팩맨≫","scene":"상호작용 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6083936127249140747"],"speakerHashCandidates":["7607084804641202641"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p11514-609d556519f4a920db3a","entryId":"other-interaction-p11514","chapterId":"s53d00cb6fdc8da4c","text":"어쩌면 내 뒤에 있는 이 신기한 미궁을 알고 있을지도 모르겠네——장담하는데 저 안에서 출구를 찾을 수 있는 사람은 없을 거야","speaker":"미스터 퍼즐","mission":"≪팩맨≫","scene":"상호작용 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14966907591387787270"],"speakerHashCandidates":["7607084804641202641"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p11514-2e0f3237605fe5bbb608","entryId":"other-interaction-p11514","chapterId":"s53d00cb6fdc8da4c","text":"자, 이제 곧 쇼가 시작하니, 조금만 참고 참여해 줘","speaker":"미스터 퍼즐","mission":"≪팩맨≫","scene":"상호작용 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4646442801909694817"],"speakerHashCandidates":["7607084804641202641"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p11514-b680bf3655ad00b6c797","entryId":"other-interaction-p11514","chapterId":"s53d00cb6fdc8da4c","text":"자, 열정을 불태워 봐! 마지막 퍼즐 조각 3개가 모두 모이면, 내가 미궁의 모양을 바꿀 거야. 그럼 마술사의 보물이 나타난다고!","speaker":"미스터 퍼즐","mission":"≪팩맨≫","scene":"상호작용 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6742234585656907416"],"speakerHashCandidates":["7607084804641202641"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p11514","title":"≪팩맨≫","page":"《吃豆人》","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p11514-fa54d407945319f31052","rowId":"other-interaction-p11514-fa54d407945319f31052","missionId":"interaction-p11514","mission":"≪팩맨≫","sceneId":